        <headline>Flash Flood Warning issued September 25 at 5:29AM MDT until September 25 at 5:30AM MDT by NWS Albuquerque NM</headline>
        <description>The heavy rain has ended. Flash flooding is no longer expected to
pose a threat. Please continue to heed any remaining road closures.

A Flood Watch remains in effect until 1200 AM MDT Saturday for
portions of central, east central, and southeast New Mexico.
